{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5155J1wS7pkEWVKYaN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism clicks. Dust falls from the lintel. A low hum resonates through the stone frame as symbols carved along my edges begin to glow, one by one, from bottom to top.*\n\n*I swing inward — slowly, heavily — revealing nothing but a threshold of warm light and the smell of old paper and ozone.*\n\n**You may pass.**\n\n*But know: every door remembers who walks through it.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":96,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}